msgid "Shared secret for the sync cron endpoints (index.php?dispatch=eurosite_cron.run&access_key=KEY&cron_mode=... and app/addons/eurosite/cron.php). Change it from the default before going live."
msgstr "Shared secret for the sync cron endpoints (index.php?dispatch=eurosite_cron.run&access_key=KEY&cron_mode=... and app/addons/eurosite/cron.php). Change it from the default before going live."

